  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Knockin' On Heaven's Door** (1 other source): Notes mention the interpretation of this song in the recording [3]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **August 2022 (Wednesday)**: rare: 4 archived performances [6]\n- **Magic Bullet**: rare: 7 archived performances [6]\n- **Only Memories Remain**: back after 30 archived shows (1372 days) [6]\n- **In Color**: rare: 12 archived performances [6]\n- **Honest Man**: back after 38 archived shows (1636 days) [6]\n- **Hopefully**: back after 28 archived shows (1195 days) [6]\n- **Phone Went West &gt**: back after 213 archived shows (5160 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [6]\n- **Knockin' On Heaven's Door**: back after 63 archived shows (2279 days); mythic rare: 2 archived performances [6]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2022-08-24.leary** (recommended): source not stated; 24 songs; 140 min; rated 5/5 by 2 [1]. Said about its sound: Listener asks if the first half of the show will be released [4]\n- **mmj2022-08-24.Schoeps_mk22_flac24**: source not stated; 22 songs; 145 min [3]\n- **mmj2022-08-24**: source not stated; 23 songs; 143 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Joy Oladokun opened the second of two nights at the venue [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2022-08-24.leary**: taped by Alex Leary; transferred by Alex Leary; source: DPA 4023 > Sound Devices MixPre-6 (24/48) [1]. Also: Recorded by Alex Leary and Andy Murray using DPA 4023 and Schoeps mk22 [1]\n- **mmj2022-08-24.Schoeps_mk22_flac24**: taped by Andy Murray; transferred by Andy Murray; source: Schoeps mk22>cmc1k>Sonosax SX-R4+ 24bit/96khz NOS [3]\n- **mmj2022-08-24**: taped by Hugh Taylor; transferred by Hugh Taylor; source: AT853 > Battery Box > Tascam DR07 24/48 wav [2]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Fan art by Todd Slater: [My Morning Jacket Live Archive - 2022-08-24 Dillon Amphitheater - Dillon, CO](https://archive.mymorningjacket.net/index.php/shows/2022-shows/2022-08-24-dillon-amphitheater-dillon-co) [7]\n- Fan art by Todd Slater: [My Morning Jacket Live Archive - 2022-08-24 Dillon Amphitheater - Dillon, CO](https://archive.mymorningjacket.net/index.php/shows/2022-shows/2022-08-24-dillon-amphitheater-dillon-co) [8]",
